              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyas uurda fuga Israeli, ghwanung' gwasin gadiyeeda hang'waayi fuga Ganaani, ak hean ea mahoana gwarita.",
          "type": "text",
