        {
          "text": "ak fuga Amori ghoabit ng'eanyi aba giibinda Heresi ea Aiyaloni, ea Shalbimu; aba gheambalmeeda eemeeda Yosefu gwajooriischi aba heanyaawa, ng'ata ghoah fuga jea gwasin gadiyeeda hang'waay. ",
